<title>GERMANY: Jungheinrich posts 1996 group net loss.</title>
<headline>Jungheinrich posts 1996 group net loss.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG, Germany 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net loss			     20	vs 47 profit</p>
<p>    Group sales				  2,410   vs 2,300</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German forklift truck maker is Jungheinrich AG. The company said it expected to report a profit of over 30 million marks on sales of 2.5 billion marks for 1997.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
